{
  "name": "Polymorph",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> WIS save or the creature turns into a Beast of your choice (CR no higher than its own CR or level) for up to an hour while you concentrate, gaining Temporary Hit Points equal to the Beast's Hit Points; the spell ends when they're gone. On a failure the creature is marked Polymorphed: the DM drags the Beast onto its sheet to transform it, and reverts it when the mark ends.</p>",
